## Rules for Claude Code in this repo

- Invoke `drupal-standards` before writing/reviewing code, `drupal-modern-core`
  before choosing an implementation approach, `drupal-module-baselines` before
  adding or recommending any module.
- Modern patterns only in new code: `#[Hook]` classes (no new procedural hooks),
  attribute plugins (no annotations), constructor injection + `autowire: true`
  (no `\Drupal::service()` in classes), SDC for reusable UI.
- Config in code: after any config change, `drush cex` and include the export in
  the same commit as the code that depends on it.
- Never edit anything under `web/core/` or `web/modules/contrib/`. Patches go
  through composer-patches with an upstream drupal.org issue link.
- Before saying work is done: `vendor/bin/phpcs`, `vendor/bin/phpstan analyse`,
  and the relevant PHPUnit group. Report the actual output.

## Tooling

Configs at repo root: `phpcs.xml.dist`, `phpstan.neon.dist`, `rector.php`
(copied from the claude-drupal-config repo's `configs/` folder — local clone
path is in the global CLAUDE.md Drupal section; adjust paths if the docroot
isn't `web/`).

```bash
composer require --dev drupal/coder phpstan/phpstan mglaman/phpstan-drupal \
  phpstan/phpstan-deprecation-rules palantirnet/drupal-rector phpunit/phpunit
```

<!-- Or on a full site build: composer require --dev drupal/core-dev -->

